Z||000051||rogergarrison||09-10-2001||04:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>In all due respect, Front engine/rear drive is considered the best by most car engineers because of it's weight balance.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>its hard to get 50/50 with front engine. Some have been done like vette with front engine and rear trans. But nothing is going to come closer to 50/50 weight balance than a mid engine design. The whole car weight is near the center between front and rear wheels.<P>||||reg||1
